"<https://github.com/openmv/qt-creator/commit/9133b1516>`__\\ ), wraz z "
"natywnymi bibliotekami współdzielonymi ``libpython3.13`` oraz ``ujson`` (\\ "
"`d3aa663d8 <https://github.com/openmv/qt-creator/commit/d3aa663d8>`__\\ , "
"`a2cb24e74 <https://github.com/openmv/qt-creator/commit/a2cb24e74>`__\\ )."

#: ../../changelog/ide/v4.4.0.rst:317
msgid ""
"**Bundled language server:** ``pylsp`` with astroid 3.3.5 on Windows, macOS,"
